WEBVTT

00:05.600 --> 00:07.650
<b>This one, too.</b>

00:15.740 --> 00:18.580
<b>Is there even an exit to begin with?</b>

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
<b>I leaked some fabricated data
in the Underwater City.</b>

00:24.000 --> 00:29.460
<b>And in pursuit of a shadow that looked like A2,
I found a strange room adorned with art.</b>

00:30.210 --> 00:35.470
<b>Even with the radio jamming, at what point
in time did I wander into cyberspace?</b>

00:37.220 --> 00:38.220
<b>That, or...</b>

00:39.220 --> 00:41.810
<b>I was forced to wander in here.</b>

00:42.850 --> 00:44.850
<b><i>Y-Y-You...</i></b>

00:45.480 --> 00:46.600
<b><i>You guys...</i></b>

00:46.770 --> 00:47.860
<b>Who's there?</b>

00:48.270 --> 00:51.110
<b><i>I announce to all androids.</i></b>

00:51.730 --> 00:55.360
<b><i>We machine lifeforms...</i></b>

00:55.860 --> 01:00.990
<b><i>We made war. Learned. Grew.</i></b>

01:01.580 --> 01:05.620
<b><i>And thus we gained
a new consciousness.</i></b>

01:06.000 --> 01:07.500
<b>What is it saying?</b>

01:07.750 --> 01:14.510
<b><i>Indeed. It is as if
a new form </i>of existence has been born.</b>

01:15.010 --> 01:17.220
<b>Existence?</b>

01:17.220 --> 01:21.890
<b>Correct. And my name is...</b>

01:23.100 --> 01:24.270
<b>Adam.</b>

02:55.940 --> 02:57.150
<b>Adam, you say?</b>

02:57.530 --> 02:59.240
<b>A mere machine...</b>

02:59.320 --> 03:02.360
<b>A mere machine cannot speak
of existence, you say?</b>

03:02.870 --> 03:06.240
<b>Then what about you androids?</b>

03:06.370 --> 03:10.000
<b>Aren't you mere puppets
who can only act according to orders?</b>

03:10.330 --> 03:11.420
<b>Shut up!</b>

03:11.620 --> 03:16.710
<b>By the way, how is that android named 2B doing?
The one who's always at your side?</b>

03:16.800 --> 03:19.420
<b>How do you know 2B's name?</b>

03:19.420 --> 03:25.350
<b>I would never forget about you two,
who watched my birth, then tried to kill me.</b>

03:25.350 --> 03:27.260
<b>So you're that special unit!</b>

03:28.140 --> 03:29.600
<b>That's right, boy.</b>

03:30.060 --> 03:33.850
<b>Perhaps you have a will.
Perhaps you have desires?</b>

03:35.610 --> 03:37.940
<b>A vile desire
that you have never shown anyone...</b>

03:39.150 --> 03:43.820
<b>slumbers in the depths of your heart.</b>

03:45.030 --> 03:49.870
<b>The more you try to hide it, the more
that distorted darkness grows.</b>

03:50.040 --> 03:51.250
<b>Shut up!</b>

03:51.250 --> 03:52.330
<b>I don't have such a...</b>

03:52.330 --> 03:54.250
<b>No need to deny it.</b>

03:54.250 --> 03:57.960
<b>- Shut up! Shut up!
- All who live are slaves to desire.</b>

03:57.960 --> 03:59.550
<b>I can't shut out this voice.</b>

03:59.840 --> 04:06.430
<b>Some seek love,
some seek families, and I...</b>

04:06.430 --> 04:08.600
<b>I'm not like you guys!</b>

04:08.850 --> 04:13.940
<b>You are no different.
You do not trust anything.</b>

04:14.480 --> 04:17.310
<b>You want to destroy everything.</b>

04:17.610 --> 04:20.820
<b>- You have lost hope in everything.
- I don't! I don't!</b>

04:21.240 --> 04:24.530
<b>- You want to obtain everything.
- I don't... I don't...</b>

04:24.950 --> 04:28.240
<b>You want to be loved by all.</b>

04:28.240 --> 04:30.540
<b>I don't... I don't...</b>

04:41.130 --> 04:43.880
<b>You think about 2B,
and how much you want to...</b>

04:45.470 --> 04:47.720
<b>Stop!</b>

04:53.560 --> 04:55.230
<b>Are you going to go look for him?</b>

04:56.060 --> 04:59.610
<b>That might be exactly what
the enemy wants. Do you need help?</b>

05:00.730 --> 05:03.490
<b>Leave the search for 9S to me.</b>

05:03.490 --> 05:06.490
<b>I'd like you to tell Lily to be alert
of what's going on around camp.</b>

05:07.360 --> 05:10.660
<b>All right. Be careful, 2B.</b>

05:17.460 --> 05:20.670
<b><i>Report. Communication has been restored.</i></b>

05:20.670 --> 05:22.300
<b>Then hurry and reach 9S.</b>

05:22.300 --> 05:23.210
<b><i>Report.</i></b>

05:23.710 --> 05:25.170
<b>Pod 153!</b>

05:25.170 --> 05:28.720
<b><i>Accompany unit 9S is in a state
of inability to supplement.</i></b>

05:29.140 --> 05:33.970
<b><i>Records immediately before loss
detects a faint machine lifeform signal.</i></b>

05:34.060 --> 05:36.730
<b><i>Requesting search-and-rescue.</i></b>

05:43.730 --> 05:48.410
<b>This is us from earlier.
Who would do this?</b>

05:48.740 --> 05:52.540
<b><i>Report. 9S was lost in this area.</i></b>

05:56.290 --> 06:01.790
<b><i>Confirmed. Numerical data predicted to be
a value that indicates a specific location.</i></b>

06:01.920 --> 06:04.510
<b><i>Value corresponds to underground sector
of the ruined city area.</i></b>

06:06.090 --> 06:08.430
<b>Pod, connect me to the Bunker.</b>

06:08.590 --> 06:09.510
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

06:10.640 --> 06:11.640
<b>Commander.</b>

06:12.050 --> 06:13.180
<b>What's wrong?</b>

06:13.180 --> 06:15.770
<b>I have an emergency request from 2B.</b>

06:15.770 --> 06:19.730
<b>There is a high possibility that 9S
was abducted during his mission,</b>

06:19.730 --> 06:22.060
<b>and with the enemy forces yet unknown,</b>

06:22.060 --> 06:26.070
<b>she requests immediate authorization
of a search squad.</b>

06:26.320 --> 06:28.740
<b>Commander, please authorize it.</b>

06:30.740 --> 06:32.160
<b>A dispatch...</b>

06:32.830 --> 06:34.240
<b>I cannot authorize one.</b>

06:35.200 --> 06:37.000
<b>However, if we don't hurry...</b>

06:37.000 --> 06:40.710
<b>Currently all search squads
in the Bunker are on duty.</b>

06:40.710 --> 06:43.920
<b>And in our current condition, it's difficult
to summon them from other warzones.</b>

06:44.710 --> 06:46.510
<b>Tell her as such.</b>

06:46.710 --> 06:48.380
<b>That cannot be! That means—</b>

06:48.380 --> 06:49.680
<b>6O.</b>

06:50.840 --> 06:53.350
<b>I understand.</b>

06:55.220 --> 06:56.970
<b><i>I'm sorry, 2B.</i></b>

06:57.640 --> 07:00.900
<b>Roger that. Don't worry about it, 6O.</b>

07:01.600 --> 07:03.560
<b>Pod, how far are we
from the target location?</b>

07:03.730 --> 07:06.940
<b><i>We will arrive
at the target location shortly.</i></b>

07:11.030 --> 07:14.910
<b><i>Report. Arrived at target location.</i></b>

07:16.490 --> 07:18.410
<b>Why in such a location...</b>

07:21.290 --> 07:24.000
<b>What? A camouflage hologram.</b>

07:25.630 --> 07:28.550
<b><i>Alert. A possible trap.</i></b>

07:41.770 --> 07:44.020
<b>COPIED CITY</b>

07:49.570 --> 07:51.150
<b>Who would build this?</b>

07:51.610 --> 07:57.330
<b><i>Unknown. Information about current location
cannot be confirmed from past records.</i></b>

07:57.330 --> 08:01.960
<b><i>Request. Authorization for 9S
search activities by this unit.</i></b>

08:02.500 --> 08:05.000
<b>Pod 153, stand by on the surface.</b>

08:05.000 --> 08:07.920
<b>Make a second request
for a backup unit to the Bunker.</b>

08:12.840 --> 08:17.430
<b><i>Analysis. This area is composed
of crystallized silicon and carbon.</i></b>

08:17.720 --> 08:20.930
<b><i>Further details unknown
due to lack of data.</i></b>

08:22.940 --> 08:26.440
<b><i>Faint black box signal detected up ahead.</i></b>

08:26.690 --> 08:31.610
<b><i>Confirmed signal pattern.
Coincides with identification code for 9S.</i></b>

08:48.960 --> 08:52.170
<b>Pod, set sensitivity of each sensor
to maximum level.</b>

08:52.170 --> 08:53.550
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

08:53.760 --> 08:56.970
<b><i>No machine lifeform signals
detected nearby.</i></b>

08:57.180 --> 09:03.310
<b><i>Stones in surrounding area are crystallized structures
of calcium sulfide, sodium chloride,</i></b>

09:03.310 --> 09:06.730
<b><i>and material that cannot be analyzed.</i></b>

09:06.730 --> 09:08.810
<b><i>No enemy signals detected.</i></b>

09:08.940 --> 09:10.980
<b>Why would such things...</b>

09:11.110 --> 09:12.320
<b><i>Unknown.</i></b>

09:28.080 --> 09:32.420
<b><i>Report. Confirmed missing
YoRHa squad members.</i></b>

10:01.990 --> 10:05.540
<b>Welcome to my beloved city.</b>

10:08.870 --> 10:10.460
<b>Where is 9S?</b>

10:11.880 --> 10:14.340
<b>Don't be so rash, 2B.</b>

10:16.130 --> 10:21.180
<b>I most certainly wanted to speak with you.
That's why I had you come here.</b>

10:21.600 --> 10:23.850
<b>My name is Adam.</b>

10:24.010 --> 10:30.190
<b>When we first met in the desert underground,
neither of us had the time to chat.</b>

10:30.190 --> 10:32.610
<b>Desert Underground?</b>

10:36.650 --> 10:37.700
<b>The special unit!</b>

10:38.110 --> 10:41.240
<b>It looks like you remembered.
That makes me happy.</b>

10:41.370 --> 10:42.910
<b>Where is 9S?</b>

10:43.030 --> 10:46.660
<b>If you slay me, you won't be able
to know his whereabouts.</b>

10:47.830 --> 10:53.090
<b>This is our playground.
We mimicked humanity in creation.</b>

10:53.840 --> 11:00.680
<b>I, or we machine lifeforms, I suppose,
have a keen interest in humanity.</b>

11:01.010 --> 11:05.100
<b>Humans are enigmatic.
Impossible to understand.</b>

11:05.640 --> 11:09.230
<b>Love. Family. War. Religion.</b>

11:09.350 --> 11:12.940
<b>The complexity of humanity
keeps fascinating me.</b>

11:13.610 --> 11:16.900
<b>We want to unravel this riddle of humanity.</b>

11:17.570 --> 11:20.610
<b>You wouldn't understand this feeling,
would you?</b>

11:21.320 --> 11:23.280
<b>You're just like them.</b>

11:24.160 --> 11:25.700
<b>What are you even talking about...</b>

11:32.040 --> 11:36.630
<b>This is what you androids have been seeking
for all these years.</b>

11:38.710 --> 11:40.590
<b>Let me introduce you...</b>

11:40.800 --> 11:42.300
<b>to our...</b>

11:42.680 --> 11:44.760
<b>creators.</b>

11:51.690 --> 11:55.650
<b>The aliens who created us
machine lifeforms.</b>

11:55.860 --> 11:58.780
<b>In other words,
these are your archnemeses.</b>

11:59.400 --> 12:01.740
<b>You've been looking for them
this whole time, yes?</b>

12:01.740 --> 12:03.700
<b>They were in a place like this.</b>

12:04.200 --> 12:07.240
<b>A touching rendezvous,
however they are already</b>

12:07.240 --> 12:08.620
<b>dead.</b>

12:08.620 --> 12:12.040
<b>They were wiped out by us centuries ago.</b>

12:12.580 --> 12:15.210
<b>Wiped out?</b>

12:15.210 --> 12:21.050
<b>Yes. Machine lifeforms are weapons capable
of evolution in order to fortify themselves.</b>

12:21.630 --> 12:29.180
<b>Intelligence budding within our network didn't
take much time to surpass that of our creators.</b>

12:29.890 --> 12:32.100
<b>Your own creators? You...</b>

12:32.430 --> 12:34.650
<b>Oh, there's no need to fret about them.</b>

12:35.020 --> 12:39.480
<b>They were simple. Infantile.
Almost like plants, I guess you'd say.</b>

12:39.480 --> 12:40.900
<b>They held no value to us.</b>

12:41.320 --> 12:45.490
<b>Humanity is far more alluring than them,</b>

12:45.490 --> 12:49.330
<b>as well as you androids.</b>

12:50.080 --> 12:53.460
<b>I've been watching all of you
this entire time.</b>

12:53.580 --> 12:57.500
<b>You, made in the image of humans,
definitely have emotions.</b>

12:57.630 --> 13:01.380
<b>Joy, sorrow, fear...</b>

13:01.800 --> 13:03.970
<b>and hatred.</b>

13:05.340 --> 13:09.350
<b>I heard YoRHa is prohibited
from harboring emotions?</b>

13:09.350 --> 13:13.430
<b>Don't you think those words in themselves
create an unfair suggestion?</b>

13:14.600 --> 13:17.060
<b>Won't you come with me, 2B?</b>

13:17.270 --> 13:19.150
<b>I have high hopes for you.</b>

13:19.820 --> 13:23.650
<b>We shall discover together the enigma
of the "heart" that humans hold.</b>

13:24.860 --> 13:26.030
<b>Where is 9S?</b>

13:27.360 --> 13:28.740
<b>I see.</b>

13:29.370 --> 13:33.620
<b>Then, I shall have "him"
continue to assist me.</b>

13:34.910 --> 13:36.210
<b>9S!</b>

13:37.630 --> 13:43.340
<b>I performed various experiments
using your beloved 9S.</b>

13:43.340 --> 13:48.890
<b>He was filled with complexity on the inside.
It was truly fascinating.</b>

13:49.010 --> 13:54.390
<b>Next, I will rip his body apart, dismantle it,
and take a direct look at what lies inside.</b>

13:54.480 --> 13:58.560
<b>That agony should draw out
even more emotions from him.</b>

13:58.770 --> 14:00.190
<b>You son of a...</b>

14:00.190 --> 14:01.070
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

14:02.860 --> 14:06.820
<b>Yes! That's it!
That's the feeling! Pure hate!</b>

14:06.820 --> 14:09.820
<b>That is exactly what I have been seeking!</b>

14:11.370 --> 14:14.790
<b>Come, 2B!</b>

14:26.010 --> 14:28.380
<b>I do enjoy this, 2B!</b>

14:42.480 --> 14:43.820
<b>That's right.</b>

14:43.820 --> 14:46.360
<b>The core of humanity is conflict.</b>

14:46.820 --> 14:49.240
<b>They fight. Steal. Kill.</b>

14:49.450 --> 14:51.200
<b>This is humanity in its purest form!</b>

14:51.200 --> 14:53.450
<b>You know nothing about humanity.</b>

14:56.370 --> 14:58.250
<b>9S...</b>

14:58.370 --> 15:01.170
<b>I went ahead and created a replica
of his cybernetic body.</b>

15:01.540 --> 15:03.090
<b>Doesn't it look good?</b>

15:03.090 --> 15:04.000
<b>Why you...</b>

15:11.680 --> 15:15.180
<b>You know it to be a fake,
yet you hesitate to attack.</b>

15:15.560 --> 15:19.100
<b>That is, in fact,
emotions that humans harbor.</b>

15:19.100 --> 15:23.060
<b>Good for you. That's proof
that you are close to humans.</b>

15:23.940 --> 15:27.570
<b>Both of us are beings
that yearn for humans.</b>

15:27.820 --> 15:32.070
<b>You can say that machine lifeforms
and androids are in the same category.</b>

15:44.130 --> 15:48.880
<b><i>Proposal. Identify the situation
and execute return fire as planned.</i></b>

15:48.880 --> 15:49.590
<b>I kno—</b>

15:50.170 --> 15:51.300
<b>Pod!</b>

15:52.970 --> 15:54.680
<b>Don't be a wet blanket!</b>

15:57.520 --> 16:01.850
<b>The infinite slaughter
on both sides all mean nothing.</b>

16:01.980 --> 16:03.940
<b>You've already realized that, haven't you?</b>

16:03.940 --> 16:05.730
<b>That humanity...</b>

16:05.980 --> 16:08.480
<b>has already gone extinct?</b>

16:08.860 --> 16:10.280
<b>Shut up!</b>

16:10.780 --> 16:13.740
<b>But that is the truth.</b>

16:13.740 --> 16:19.290
<b>I want to reach the abyss of humanity
that no longer exists.</b>

16:19.580 --> 16:24.330
<b>However, we machine lifeforms
are in a connected network.</b>

16:24.330 --> 16:25.420
<b>We are invincible.</b>

16:25.960 --> 16:29.460
<b>Within all those infinite bits of data,
not even the merest flicker of life exists.</b>

16:29.590 --> 16:33.840
<b>The concept of death has no meaning to us.</b>

16:34.010 --> 16:38.600
<b>Thus, I decided to sever
my connection to the network.</b>

16:41.560 --> 16:47.400
<b>Now, if you kill me,
you can rescue your beloved 9S.</b>

16:57.700 --> 16:59.120
<b>2B.</b>

17:00.790 --> 17:03.000
<b>9S...</b>

17:06.130 --> 17:09.500
<b>So how is it? Can you see death, 2B?</b>

17:10.250 --> 17:15.010
<b><i>Report. We have arrived...
at the designated time.</i></b>

17:16.550 --> 17:18.390
<b>I have...</b>

17:18.760 --> 17:21.470
<b>bought enough time.</b>

17:22.520 --> 17:23.640
<b>What?</b>

17:23.640 --> 17:26.730
<b>Someone is intervening into my system?</b>

17:27.060 --> 17:28.440
<b>Who is it?</b>

17:30.770 --> 17:33.740
<b>Make a second request
for a backup unit to the Bunker.</b>

17:34.240 --> 17:36.280
<b><i>Denying request.</i></b>

17:36.530 --> 17:40.330
<b><i>This unit's control rights
are still set to 9S.</i></b>

17:40.530 --> 17:45.710
<b><i>Also, there is no guarantee that backup
from Command will arrive.</i></b>

17:45.790 --> 17:47.120
<b>Then what are you planning to do?</b>

17:47.420 --> 17:52.760
<b><i>This unit will hack into the main system
while the enemy engages with 2B.</i></b>

17:52.840 --> 17:56.090
<b><i>Requesting 2B to buy time for the hacking.</i></b>

17:57.010 --> 17:58.680
<b>What's the chance of success?</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.600
<b><i>Chance of success: 36%.</i></b>

18:01.970 --> 18:05.390
<b><i>This unit will support Pod 153's proposal.</i></b>

18:05.730 --> 18:12.480
<b><i>Adding this unit's computation to the current situation
will increase success rate to 45%.</i></b>

18:13.440 --> 18:18.820
<b>All right. Pod 153, please hack in
while we act as decoy.</b>

18:18.990 --> 18:20.160
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

18:20.910 --> 18:26.120
<b><i>Control percentage 92... 93...</i></b>

18:26.620 --> 18:29.880
<b><i>94... 95...</i></b>

18:30.170 --> 18:34.630
<b>Interesting.
So you're going to infiltrate me!</b>

18:36.550 --> 18:41.140
<b><i>100%.
S-System... controlled...</i></b>

18:48.810 --> 18:52.060
<b>So even I have been overtaken.</b>

18:54.110 --> 18:56.940
<b>Is it a result of severing myself
from the network?</b>

19:00.320 --> 19:07.080
<b>Oh, right. Indeed, you were my death.</b>

19:17.130 --> 19:19.760
<b>Elder Brother.</b>

19:21.590 --> 19:22.680
<b>Eve.</b>

19:23.260 --> 19:27.680
<b>I... I'm going to protect Elder Brother.</b>

19:43.620 --> 19:46.040
<b>I need to hurry to 9S.</b>

19:46.040 --> 19:47.330
<b><i>Report...</i></b>

19:47.750 --> 19:51.710
<b><i>Succeeded rescue of 9S.</i></b>

19:51.790 --> 19:57.300
<b><i>Proposal. Immediate departure...
from this area.</i></b>

19:59.220 --> 20:00.550
<b>9S!</b>

20:05.640 --> 20:06.890
<b>2B.</b>

20:08.140 --> 20:10.730
<b>Let's go home, 9S.</b>

20:10.890 --> 20:12.060
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:34.580 --> 20:35.630
<b>Eve.</b>

20:37.210 --> 20:38.460
<b>Hey.</b>

20:39.090 --> 20:44.130
<b>When we get back home,
let's play again, okay?</b>

20:44.800 --> 20:46.430
<b>Brother.</b>

20:54.810 --> 20:55.980
<b>Eve.</b>

22:40.580 --> 22:43.000
<b>POD 042 REPORTING TO ALL OF MANKIND.</b>

22:40.580 --> 22:43.000
<b>WE WILL NOW EXECUTE THE TASK
OF INTRODUCING THE MULTIPLE ENDINGS
FOR THE VIDEO GAME "NIER:AUTOMATA." OVER.</b>

22:44.090 --> 22:46.170
<b>PUPPET PLAY
NIER:AUTOMATA
"AN ENCOURAGEMENT OF T-SHIRTS"</b>

22:49.260 --> 22:52.430
<b>Yes, yes! Hello!
Sorry for taking a break last time.</b>

22:52.430 --> 22:54.600
<b>I will give it my best effort,
since I took some time off.</b>

22:54.600 --> 22:57.060
<b>This is YoRHa No. 9 Type S AKA 9S and...</b>

22:57.060 --> 23:00.100
<b>Likewise, YoRHa No. 2 Type B AKA 2B.</b>

23:00.100 --> 23:04.110
<b>I know this is sudden, but I thought of
a T-shirt design just for 2B!</b>

23:04.110 --> 23:04.860
<b>Huh?</b>

23:04.860 --> 23:07.150
<b><i>Begin sharing of information.</i></b>

23:08.900 --> 23:10.700
<b>How is it, 2B?</b>

23:10.700 --> 23:14.990
<b>Thank you. In return, I thought of a design
that would suit you.</b>

23:13.620 --> 23:18.370
<b>ACORN</b>

23:14.990 --> 23:17.290
<b>Amazing! Thank you so much!</b>

23:18.580 --> 23:23.210
<b>COUNCIL OF HUMANITY</b>

23:18.710 --> 23:20.000
<b>I came up with this idea, too.</b>

23:20.000 --> 23:22.130
<b>Wow! This is perfect for the Commander!</b>

23:22.130 --> 23:24.880
<b>Then how about something
like this for the Operators?</b>

23:23.500 --> 23:25.340
<b>FAMILY</b>

23:24.880 --> 23:27.460
<b>- I think I would do this instead.
- Excellent!</b>

23:27.460 --> 23:28.630
<b>By the way, if it's Jackass...</b>

23:28.010 --> 23:30.890
<b>MACKEREL</b>

23:28.630 --> 23:31.180
<b>Cool! It's so cool, 2B!</b>

23:31.180 --> 23:33.350
<b>I don't know why. I keep getting ideas,
and I can't stop.</b>

23:31.930 --> 23:32.600
<b>ENEMY</b>

23:34.600 --> 23:37.350
<b>2B and 9S chose to abandon their mission,
allowing the machines to wreak destruction
upon the city ruins and Resistance camp.
The extinction of YoRHa
is also surely a matter of time.</b>

23:38.100 --> 23:40.020
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>
